ted":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"`sqlalchemy` is failing to reflect table comments from an Oracle database:\r\n```python\r\nIn [52]: insp = Inspector.from_engine(engine)\r\n\r\nIn [53]: insp.get_table_comment('BIDDAYOFFER', 'INFOSERVER')\r\n2020-02-11 14:32:54,051 INFO sqlalchemy.engine.base.Engine \r\n            SELECT comments\r\n            FROM user_tab_comments\r\n            WHERE table_name = :table_name\r\n        \r\n2020-02-11 14:32:54,052 INFO sqlalchemy.engine.base.Engine {'table_name': 'BIDDAYOFFER'}\r\nOut[53]: {'text': None}\r\n```\r\n\r\nDigging about a bit and the comment is actually in the `ALL_TAB_COMMENTS` table:\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/881019/74211435-aa7ba480-4cdb-11ea-8a24-e608a868347c.png)\r\n\r\nFrom [the Oracle docs](https://docs.oracle.com/cd/B19306_01/server.102/b14237/statviews_2095.htm#REFRN20278) \r\n\r\n> *`ALL_TAB_COMMENTS` displays comments on the tables and views **accessible** to the current user*\r\n\r\n...whereas:\r\n\r\n> *`USER_TAB_COMMENTS ` displays comments on the tables and views **owned** by the current user*\r\n\r\nIt seems unnecessarily restrictive to only reflect comments on tables ***owned*** by the current user?\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/5146/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/5146/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}